{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_title", "source_sha256": "314e5b89ce0f56f2bcce8767f7117d4e7f6e6bf1bd05fc239d665b9c223ad676", "ja": "奇跡の星", "zh": "奇迹之星", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_synopsis", "source_sha256": "05b34d939807fbeee4394f1be09ccad470867302ebc2e81b67445acdcd7fe003", "ja": "イベントを前に仲間との意識の差に悩む昴に\n「自分の強みは何か言葉にする」という宿題\nが出る。兄達に励まされ、プロデューサー\nから「ただ輝けばいい」と告げられた昴は、\nソロ曲披露を賭けたオーディションに挑む。", "zh": "活动在即，昴却因与同伴的想法差距而苦恼，\n此时她接到了“用言语表达自己的优势”\n这一课题。在哥哥们的鼓励下，制作人\n也告诉她“只要尽情闪耀就好”，\n昴随即迎来了争夺独唱曲表演机会的试镜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1000_047sub", "source_sha256": "236c593645daae925d5691a0c3316b5e14e0f7d27c6e20332a34152a8fff09b4", "ja": "オレのアイドルとしての強みを説明する、かぁ……。", "zh": "要说明我作为偶像的优势啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "0d1941ec3575155e0c1b19b816d34e11784c46eafc4b4aa2621be70d3be4a11e", "ja": "言葉でってのが難しいよな～。\nていうか、そもそもオレの強みってなんだ……？", "zh": "要用语言说出来还真难啊～。\n话说回来，老子的优点到底是什么啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "ae03f6d4c70f1290428e37d4a643db1db23f7bbbe18a95a2a89fe2603b3bddab", "ja": "ダメだー、全然わかんないよ！\nうう、千本ノックのほうがよっぽどマシだぜ……。", "zh": "不行——完全搞不明白啊！\n呜呜，还是做千本击球训练更轻松……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1003_souta", "source_sha256": "eaac5e0a2ffc1977755974aac55171efedeeb5f3bf654291ba8f07ef1f0f4a86", "ja": "おっ、千本ノックするのか？　昴。\n兄ちゃんが付き合ってやろうか？", "zh": "哦，要练千本球吗？昴。\n哥哥陪你一起练吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "46aebb8d6d770fa6702ea6158a54d6bb69d3bf0176e8120ba00c58898df640ec", "ja": "颯太兄ちゃん……。今のは、ホントにやるってワケじゃ\nなくて、たとえなの！　ちょっと考えごとしてただけ。", "zh": "飒太哥哥……刚才那不是说真的要做啦，只是打个比方！我刚才只是在想事情而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1005_hiroto", "source_sha256": "c39010262fe0f3a55cd6c308840894612ec8b7cacab2ffbcd90e9db6835c2ef6", "ja": "え、昴なんか悩んでんの？　よしっ、兄ちゃん達が\n相談に乗ってやるぞ！　おーい、全員集合～！", "zh": "欸，昴，你有什么烦恼吗？好！哥哥们来帮你想办法！  \n喂——大家集合～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "74928586191aa71f41c711402bea5d1f4ec5082080e840516f2e14b0970930e4", "ja": "ちょっ……祐翔兄ちゃん、別にいいってば！\nあーあ、みんな来ちゃったよ……もう……。", "zh": "等一下……祐翔哥哥，真的不用啦！\n啊——大家都过来了……真是的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "1aa11f036924980e5819ea9220c93f31975d272201a672b8567d809ef203b609", "ja": "まあいいか。\nヒントくらいにはなりそうだし……。", "zh": "嘛，也行吧。\n感觉至少能当个参考……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1008_masato", "source_sha256": "f7a94cab3da57fec12e8725859502440b6ac18b457b85b945c664dd4302b56db", "ja": "ヒント？　なんだ、何の話だ？", "zh": "提示？那是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "9f78b00ea377524a5deae2d9240eaca5834332888690cf5b7834cc811e3f4ad4", "ja": "あのさ、兄ちゃんたち。\nオレの強みって、何だと思う？", "zh": "那个，哥哥们。\n你们觉得我的优点是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1010_souta", "source_sha256": "90c912ae7d4b8d216a34877c19272afe6aeea5e8b7df55459003517bed183b8e", "ja": "サウスポー。", "zh": "左撇子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1011_taiki", "source_sha256": "82f934b255611e6c9fac7aa13dc677228857f78c059798be94b1b03beac8c438", "ja": "肩？", "zh": "肩膀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "916f1912ff86fa1d791d1dd8ba39487107e19a7fede3be6a8d4491a1e9690158", "ja": "いやだから野球じゃなくて！\nその……アイドルとしてってこと！", "zh": "不是啦，就说不是棒球了！\n那个……是作为偶像来说啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1013_subaanitachi", "source_sha256": "d5e3a8d99208607f6a7260c822a16c882f5d656d6cd6b2591220ebce913b92e6", "ja": "カワイイところ。", "zh": "可爱的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "747bff2569a1341af498649421f3e31f4099110c9704ad2d0d2467373b094d7e", "ja": "そういうんでもなくてー！\nもう、真面目に聞いたオレがバカだったよ……。", "zh": "不是那种意思啦——！\n真是的，亏我还认真听你说……是我傻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1015_hiroto", "source_sha256": "4a693fb6ee366f133d09d076eb96783887eb8aeef533b4d196647117c2143506", "ja": "いいじゃん、カワイイのはホントなんだから。\nてか、どうしたんだよ？　急に。", "zh": "有什么关系嘛，可爱本来就是事实啊。\n话说回来，你怎么了？这么突然。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1016_masato", "source_sha256": "28e58c5db17c07a78293d0e8954e3047c2ed8aa6dfd0216837cda93d9910e898", "ja": "昴……アイドルの仕事で、何かあったのか？", "zh": "昴……在偶像工作上，发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "1324af5183629e1246c4f6409ffec01694b75f85109dfe8744008b1aa86be16f", "ja": "うっ。それがさ……。", "zh": "呃，这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1019_taiki", "source_sha256": "263c0f97cded823f1d9161475271c0985807eec0f35de0b1b7b87a478d41dd99", "ja": "なるほど、宿題ね……。\nそれは、そうなって当然の展開だろうな。", "zh": "原来如此，是作业啊……。\n事情发展成那样，也是理所当然的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "e07adc00a2df08d7be332e5c460c0ed741d878799143159ff33815aa3a9fda1a", "ja": "うう……。だって、みんなすっごく真剣でさ。\nオレ、なんか自信なくなっちゃって……。", "zh": "呜呜……因为大家都特别认真嘛。\n我……不知怎么的，变得没自信了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1021_hiroto", "source_sha256": "a197c23983ab7a9eb9959a0f12696d0ee6b91b02600bc84d6fb6257e97f0f899", "ja": "そりゃ、みんな真剣に決まってるだろー。\nてかオレ、昴もそうだと思ってたけど？", "zh": "那当然了，大家肯定都很认真啊——\n话说，我还以为昴也是这么想的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "c363e019f266057f635a654be8f1c3d381236a67f5d34025064d9978bd807f20", "ja": "お、オレだって真剣だよ！\nけど、レベルが違うっていうか……。", "zh": "哦、我、我也是很认真的啊！\n不过，该说是水平不一样……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "5fb359af39ef6ae366547e4886a020553c9e1b2cb5296414552b82d324978c50", "ja": "はぁ……。こんなんじゃオレ、みんなに\nどんどん置いてかれちゃうよ……。", "zh": "唉……这样下去的话，我会被大家越甩越远的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1024_taiki", "source_sha256": "ac9aea50891d1bdc0ed0937c892602cd43ec058219d550194a1c213939567b9f", "ja": "だったら、諦めて誰かと交代してもらうか？\n出演したい子は、昴の他にもいるんだろ。", "zh": "那就放弃吧，换个人来出演？\n想出演的孩子，除了昴以外也还有吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1025_047sub", "source_sha256": "4ef19be28dd741c84ce5072f29e590c160b9662243021475775240cf4237688d", "ja": "それは嫌だ！　せっかく{$P$}が\nオレを選んでくれたんだ。絶対、諦めないからな！", "zh": "我才不要！难得{$P$}选中了我。我绝对不会放弃的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1026_souta", "source_sha256": "aad38acd0a18b9d8ccdf1f05b8555956487e2eb13e954d30f10b96a50850bf14", "ja": "そう！　昴は選ばれたんだ。たくさんいる中からな。\nスタメンってことだぞ？　もっと自信持て。諦めるな。", "zh": "没错！昴可是从那么多人中被选出来的。  \n也就是说，你是首发成员啊？再自信一点。别放弃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1027_souta", "source_sha256": "f282ff4aede9f1fa8aaa631e4f0ab225e31cba471d16b3b9d0780371fe61819a", "ja": "弱気は厳禁だ！　スタメンってのは、選ばれなかった\nみんなの気持ちも背負って、胸張らなきゃダメだろ？", "zh": "绝不能示弱！身为正选队员，\n就必须背负起落选大家的期盼，昂首挺胸才行吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1028_047sub", "source_sha256": "53fcafaeb6a7b61f7e9fcf59c2ce21199217f46eb2e96a5f3bb9e20bf8ea817e", "ja": "う……そ、そうだよな……。", "zh": "唔……也、也是啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1029_masato", "source_sha256": "5705bf211b1e9e5213d30e20750f024c22d0432e860b6c06df2c7ce745df66e5", "ja": "颯太の言うとおりだな。自分が選ばれたって\nわかってるなら、最後まで頑張れ。", "zh": "飒太说得没错。既然你明白自己是被选中的，就努力到最后吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1030_masato", "source_sha256": "7ccfc5aab1b2fbeb5f4e9a00be7c1a6b05c7aaed4f4b30db943a2407f3dc4529", "ja": "大丈夫だ、昴なら絶対にできる。\nイベントには、俺達も応援しに行くから。", "zh": "没事的，是昂的话绝对没问题。\n活动当天，我们也会去为你加油的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1031_047sub", "source_sha256": "8b729275d5aafd3096b2b603237aea7d9de64276bdc78bf533b27f89df0a3be6", "ja": "将人兄ちゃん……うん、わかったよ。\nそうだよな。弱気じゃダメだよな……。", "zh": "将人哥……嗯，我知道了。\n是啊。可不能这么没出息啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1032_047sub", "source_sha256": "917d6cafab976e741f598733a3b6c4a115be68665dcf666fbd19cfa0ed4e3107", "ja": "えっと……話聞いてくれてありがと！\nオレ、がんばってみる！", "zh": "那个……谢谢你愿意听我说！\n我会努力试试看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1033_subaanitachi", "source_sha256": "b5b20dbf03c04583c34840757f14deaaf5b7b782796ba7738947d3d5e6d6cf8f", "ja": "おう！", "zh": "哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1034_null", "source_sha256": "36ce4a87c57655d591159396fae1a04efc824e3532c4d4f93ce10f6ad76b4f6f", "ja": "合同記者会見当日……", "zh": "联合记者招待会当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1035_p", "source_sha256": "83558b3d8f7713ce08e677ef3cab228ce5ae0baffb58f497a18bf022771f0f45", "ja": "（各事務所からイベントの出演アイドルが発表された。\n昴達も、記者団の前で元気に挨拶をしている）", "zh": "（各事务所公布了参加活动的偶像。昴她们也在记者面前精神十足地打着招呼）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1036_p", "source_sha256": "a186c7ec67fe695c505f8a8bb2c96643739ffc2fbfb4f1b84fe45e3f277ff6f2", "ja": "（この後はさっそく、イベントの説明会だ。\n何か、重大発表があるという事だったけど……）", "zh": "（接下来马上就是活动说明会了。听说好像会有重大消息……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1038_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0533834fbfa574a725b30d7ff00038c193312182043b4d31ebb108bb5f2844ae", "ja": "ふぅ、説明会やっと終わった～♪　あ、そうだ。\nせっかくだし、他の事務所の子と話してみたいかも～。", "zh": "呼，说明会终于结束了～♪　啊，对了。\n难得有这个机会，我也想和其他事务所的孩子聊聊天～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1039_016tsu", "source_sha256": "74bb11ca792d8af8355d6f857b6fc351e863682a169c46c9f62b0e76915168d1", "ja": "って、あれ？　なんか、にらまれた気がする……。\nもしかして、みんなピリピリしてる感じですか？", "zh": "咦，奇怪？总觉得好像被瞪了……。\n难道说，大家都处于剑拔弩张的状态吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1040_050jul", "source_sha256": "d3eae52fc213c4e9b5ab1de006ccad1991301abc0afd33d4952f594bf157791e", "ja": "合同レッスンの最終日に、ソロ曲担当を決める\nオーディションがあるなんて聞かされたら、そりゃな。", "zh": "要是被告知在联合练习的最后一天，\n还要举办选拔独唱担当的试镜，那也是难怪的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1041_050jul", "source_sha256": "d639b62031458028754a9e8a024882073495024bfd88bc5fae4f2ce2a8fc2f11", "ja": "当然、ほとんど全員、ソロを狙ってくるだろ。\nこいつは想像以上の修羅場になりそうだ。", "zh": "想也知道，几乎所有人都会冲着独唱去吧。\n看来会变成超乎想象的修罗场啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1042_033sih", "source_sha256": "2b2ccb30cfe8364f6041d3da0bdeee355ef95f4022bf0305f12ea5820a42bb61", "ja": "ソロは全員ではないと聞いていましたが、\nオーディション……絶対に、合格したいです。", "zh": "我听说并不是所有人都会争取独唱，\n所以……我一定要通过选拔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1043_p", "source_sha256": "5d3caebef96d2bc9f3c7c7d1a4a64c94f62e6d5841d0e7af9fdcd727f0f77a76", "ja": "そうだな。しかも選曲は自由。\nプロデューサーとしても、腕が鳴るよ。", "zh": "没错。而且选歌也是自由的。\n作为制作人，我也跃跃欲试了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1044_031tom", "source_sha256": "8ca41d296c2f0082c6a54068823d0dff703bc63dbaf1fd4027358b27b53eff62", "ja": "では私たち全員、オーディション挑戦ということで……\n落ちても受かっても、恨みっこなしですよ～♪", "zh": "那么就由我们所有人一起参加试镜挑战……\n不管落选还是通过，都不许记仇哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1045_047sub", "source_sha256": "766e4aee5f0d8d283cc7916327030df1c3db424ab5eb4ea56b3130de46d86506", "ja": "事務所の選抜メンバーばっかりなのに、\nそこからさらにオーディションするのか……。", "zh": "明明全都是事务所选出的成员，居然还要在其中再进行选拔吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1046_047sub", "source_sha256": "5bb3e30799bcef4b8d005cdccfc59b166b8a6ff31405bda1328772c7c1b9e238", "ja": "勝てばリーグ優勝どころか、\n日本一みたいなもんってことか……？　うわ……。", "zh": "赢了的话，别说是联赛冠军，简直就等于日本第一了吧……？呜哇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1047_047sub", "source_sha256": "b02c507b6c25806e94ae8c54389cd1bfe99a683ef38dc531920c20d29be1bcdf", "ja": "っと、弱気はダメだよな。\nオレはスタメン、オレはスタメン！", "zh": "等等，不能泄气啊。  \n我可是首发，我可是首发！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1048_050jul", "source_sha256": "d704ce256a2a2270537fbe6020c60c929824d10480a10200f55616e1d6fc9f73", "ja": "おいおい、なに今から緊張してんだ、バカ昴。\nあんまり気負いすぎるなっての。", "zh": "喂喂，这才刚开始你就紧张什么啊，笨蛋昴。\n都说了，别太紧绷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1049_047sub", "source_sha256": "2e4bdb5f68ba726e37b6e92a0e592770fa4ad0ef0ff1aa5606c369fbaf15e31f", "ja": "う、うるさいな。そういうジュリアは、\n緊張してないのかよ。", "zh": "吵、吵死了。那茱莉亚你呢，\n难道就不紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1050_050jul", "source_sha256": "33b29a3d8adb754c8be8b97d67cf2ee2f6b80f349fdf6604a31d57f331a8fd28", "ja": "まあね。オーディションも大事だけど、ウチらの一番の\n目的は、このステージに爪痕を残すこと……だろ？", "zh": "嗯，是啊。试镜固然重要，但我们最主要的目的，是要在这个舞台上留下属于我们的印记……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1051_033sih", "source_sha256": "d1117b4c6c468250c78eeada7abf71a71c7bda7c3264166af84868af394ca3f9", "ja": "そうですね。このイベントで私たちを知ってもらって、\nひとりでも多くファンを増やさないと……。", "zh": "是啊。要通过这次活动让大家认识我们，还得尽可能多地增加粉丝才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1052_031tom", "source_sha256": "a24c92a008db7c2f92cf7a3ae9b3ea349cc55a5c779ec852bef1ac900f92216f", "ja": "そうですね～。みんなを聖母の愛で包んで、\n子豚ちゃんをたくさん増やしましょう～♪", "zh": "是呀～让圣母的爱包容大家，再多增加一些小猪猪吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1053_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c1ae43ea3e9be4bf33c4a0945ec71b37cee299656a9e4f315d536dea8001c7d1", "ja": "わたしはカワイイから、いっぱい増えちゃうと思うな♪\n{$P$}さん、楽しみにしててね！", "zh": "因为我很可爱，所以肯定会增加很多的哦♪\n{$P$}先生，敬请期待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1054_047sub", "source_sha256": "8efbf093d883d264dbd20fc9e353339642468254b7c5eccde6614a43dbee9861", "ja": "はぁ……みんな、やっぱすごいな……。", "zh": "哈啊……大家果然都好厉害啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1055_047sub", "source_sha256": "db86d3c6c90d7648c7326646546e48d2efd066f94f59569238e1c3e81137506c", "ja": "オレなんて「緊張する～」とか、「失敗したら\nどうしよ～！？」とかばっか考えてたのに……。", "zh": "我却只顾着想“好紧张啊——”“要是失败了该怎么办啊——！？”之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1056_047sub", "source_sha256": "ccf702d46f144c359addfac921ecff921567633d0f10b5531684a05d40335258", "ja": "なあ、翼。もし本番でうまくいかなかったらとか、\nそういうの考えないのか？", "zh": "喂，翼。你就没想过要是正式演出时没发挥好之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1057_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3ae7def50b881b23854605099e246a3c1aadb5799d109e500e42fbc24925e20e", "ja": "うーん、考えないわけじゃないですけど……。\n失敗したら、その時はその時かなって！", "zh": "嗯，也不是完全不去想，只是……\n要是失败了，到时候再说吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1058_047sub", "source_sha256": "c9e6bd987a73a5d8f00f3ddd95797d8448aa75694559d5378cca06b9fe54f1ea", "ja": "軽っ！？　マジかよ……\nメンタル強すぎだって……。", "zh": "好轻！？真的假的……\n心理素质也太强了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1059_033sih", "source_sha256": "a27a4bb9abe2aed01513afdf4eedbd61a8ecf2d06e2c9cc4418255eae697eda5", "ja": "翼は少し能天気すぎる気もしますけど、\n間違ったことは言っていないと思います。", "zh": "翼有时候似乎太过天真乐观了，不过我觉得她说得并没有错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1060_033sih", "source_sha256": "118a162e0f89a8dcd79c544e3cfa0aa35be2bcfec16cd2ca7d309559f8845686", "ja": "もちろん、失敗しないのが一番ですけど。", "zh": "当然，不失败才是最好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1061_047sub", "source_sha256": "513f2379b9039055655498632097355c8caaf615e2e7bcebd2c4edd2a12e1e43", "ja": "そ、そうだよな……。", "zh": "对、对啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1062_p", "source_sha256": "6f7c31546d4b7421deb12fba14495b7cd0ee88a3255701b1c5315868135a6e33", "ja": "（今までなら全員、昴のような反応が普通だった。\nみんな、成長したんだな……）", "zh": "（如果是以前，大家都会像昴那样反应才正常。大家都成长了啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1063_031tom", "source_sha256": "04bd0292b0fa41eed7f9f657d991354db0a27546ef4b5ecfe55e0257c0edea33", "ja": "{$P$}さん～？\n何をニヤニヤしているんですか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生～？\n你在那儿偷笑什么呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1064_p", "source_sha256": "c018ce4cf36de2021e4a8522c59649fefa34e698091fa4cf333524f415b9ca15", "ja": "おっと、すまない。\nみんな頼もしくなったなと思ってな。", "zh": "哎呀，抱歉。\n只是觉得大家都变得可靠了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1065_p", "source_sha256": "0190e2996a9cf2d02f26fb9ef5c67538c1292ee3480f7f1ce055ff5db1f03250", "ja": "でも、翼の言うとおりだよ。\n失敗したら、その時はその時で対処するしかない。", "zh": "不过，正如翼所说。\n要是失败了，到时候再想办法应对就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1066_050jul", "source_sha256": "1aa325831083f2adfd324611e96f22080f57cc60dfdf19381fd2035d674eded6", "ja": "ミスしないために練習するってのは当然だけど、\nミスしたらどうするかってのも、練習の内かもな。", "zh": "为了不出错而练习是理所当然的，不过，练习出错后该怎么办，或许也是练习的一部分吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1067_047sub", "source_sha256": "de31145ac4130af1f0fbd442b6b80473e2f2ea2582c609d606c3fbec2ff4fc7f", "ja": "なるほど。野球でいうと、\nカバーリングの練習みたいなものか……。", "zh": "原来如此。用棒球来比喻的话，\n就是练习补位之类的吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1068_031tom", "source_sha256": "1377fbca780a927e74df9a4511ffca576428a742452f04a881cdc6b90bc58251", "ja": "そうですね～。ソロ以外では、私たちはチームです～。\n誰かが失敗すれば、当然カバーしますよ～。", "zh": "是的～。除了独唱以外，我们就是一个团队～  \n要是有人失误了，当然要互相补位啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1069_047sub", "source_sha256": "f348e425aabd206d0a81983ace85ae31e02f1bfe7ed7a796458da51e9a55a409", "ja": "おう！　そうだな、失敗したらとかもう考えない！\n失敗しても余裕なくらい、練習する！", "zh": "哦！没错，不再考虑失败什么的了！\n要练到就算失败也能从容应对的程度！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1070_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3e62c22e9648bc3faaa8f2dc3004135af3bd17415bbe3322b6fb5f3b30609243", "ja": "うんうん、その調子だよ！\nあはは、昴くん元気になってよかった～♪", "zh": "嗯嗯，就是这个状态！\n啊哈哈，昴你能打起精神来真是太好了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1071_047sub", "source_sha256": "b20cf8dafe8d35fde26679c5df9fc55516b807b3c26cbe33a0740673285d8f21", "ja": "うん。\n……ありがとな、みんな！", "zh": "嗯。\n……谢谢大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1072_null", "source_sha256": "b1f7fa098ba999323c22d5fdf5a1eb4f0bc8187e62dd91c56b019f2a052479ce", "ja": "合同レッスン初日……", "zh": "联合练习第一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1073_p", "source_sha256": "c0ea569d5012e64f6577126b39c837e436f9d7cdd559b17753f035203cee9a8a", "ja": "（今日から合同レッスン開始だ。どこのアイドルも\n気合い十分、そこかしこで火花が散っている）", "zh": "（从今天开始联合训练。无论哪个地方的偶像都干劲十足，到处都火花四溅。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1074_047sub", "source_sha256": "0b486c99ed583a965346d0a237c0ddf998e89da27ec5904eb7aeeb1686ff4a9e", "ja": "なぁ、{$P$}……ここにいる子たち、\nよく見たらみんな、すっげーカワイイじゃん！！", "zh": "喂，{$P$}……仔细一看，这里的女孩们个个都超可爱嘛！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1075_p", "source_sha256": "16e32de2a2eaf3aff96ff709bb13cb90a23851e4091ba76a0a15bf600f506866", "ja": "各事務所イチオシのアイドルが集まっているからな。\n外見だけじゃなく、実力もある子ばかりだろう。", "zh": "毕竟聚集在这里的，可都是各大事务所力推的偶像。\n她们不仅外表出众，而且肯定全都是很有实力的孩子吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1076_047sub", "source_sha256": "e62dde7c5ddcfce093d187cf24947496b49d4c536a2603d336cefa4a12953dbf", "ja": "どうしよう……こんな大勢の中でオレ、\nちゃんと見つけてもらえるのかな？", "zh": "怎么办……在这么多人当中，我真的能被好好发现吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1077_047sub", "source_sha256": "fffaeddf002b47159d9663781710a93d31222b0f31a611243f6230423c20c087", "ja": "いや、自信がないわけじゃないけど！\nでもオレ、背も小さいし……。", "zh": "不，我也不是没有自信啦！\n可是我个子又小……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1078_p", "source_sha256": "d4ba513f18ef640c0c436bbb4c2566f693d5bfa948612b6af614775fba7b4681", "ja": "見つけてもらう、か。それはちょっと違うかもな。\nだって昴は、『昴』なんだから。", "zh": "被人发现，是吗。这个说法可能有点不太对。\n因为昴就是\"昴\"嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1079_047sub", "source_sha256": "f7ef97e03e3c1ea83fab3bb96db55b81a214d4491020d6d049221c9f0ab875ea", "ja": "オレはオレ？\nえーっと……どういうこと？", "zh": "我是我？\n呃……这是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1080_p", "source_sha256": "450912e8ab4d739914c72876fdd43f450128309e9b05b607968a935365aa226a", "ja": "昴は、自分の名前の由来は知ってるか？", "zh": "昴，你知道自己名字的由来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1081_047sub", "source_sha256": "b2bbe661f8a14d82960d86cdbd6dc4731e77b45a7712eea44c28a66c02090a40", "ja": "オレの名前？　えっと……\n星の名前だろ。なんとか星団っていう……。", "zh": "我的名字？呃……\n是星星的名字吧。叫什么星团来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1082_p", "source_sha256": "6c7d485b3da7e5529fed429e4394bc35653f58db4b6841acb25d92c5134d8d19", "ja": "プレアデス星団。牡牛座の星の集まりだな。\n明るくて、すごく綺麗なんだよ。", "zh": "昴星团，是金牛座的一群星星。\n既明亮又十分美丽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1083_047sub", "source_sha256": "fc7256f35de7580a9bbe592d31e3ee1709d42e6dab2cadd666aebfced1532e38", "ja": "そ、そうなんだ。明るくて綺麗か……へへ。\nあ、でもそれがどうかしたの？", "zh": "哦、这样啊。明亮又漂亮……嘿嘿。啊，不过那又怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1084_p", "source_sha256": "abc557ba253bc87a3fc6ad88f305328d6e8f5649017d424ea7ac05b73e044a91", "ja": "冬の空なら、すぐに見つけられる。\nふっとそこに目を向ければ、自然と目に留まるんだ。", "zh": "如果是在冬日的天空中，很快就能找到。\n只要不经意间望向那里，自然而然就会映入眼帘。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1085_p", "source_sha256": "ebaf0fa2c45baf652bc1e034f15717b1295e29e0c104aee595a6258f36884d46", "ja": "昴っていうのは、そういう存在なんだよ。だから昴も、\n見つけてもらおうとか考えずに、ただ輝けばいいんだ。", "zh": "昴就是这样的存在。所以昴也不用想着让别人来发现自己，只需要尽情闪耀就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1086_047sub", "source_sha256": "7494dda74f7d569d9e3edcb3ec37a1c8457ea04cbbda14d329928959f0abb16c", "ja": "ただ輝けば……。", "zh": "只要闪耀就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1087_047sub", "source_sha256": "79d5d41137d0c881bf23dfb65462002b2892feb95d10d23a0bd0ab90a9d1d3ac", "ja": "はー、なるほどなー。\n{$P$}って、物知りなんだな。", "zh": "哈——原来是这样啊。\n{$P$}还真是博学呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1088_047sub", "source_sha256": "48cac4ccc01231f8d6f72bcd0322bc3fa2f1d86148fb79671eda146a6a80d9a8", "ja": "ただ輝けばいい……うん。\nよくわかんないけど、なんかわかったぜ！", "zh": "只要闪耀就好了……嗯。\n虽然不太明白，但好像明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1089_p", "source_sha256": "e75188df2ee21d192bb8b62c0a2a255be3b43eab16da78a5e661c2e3bdb2eae3", "ja": "はは、そうか。\n少しでも伝わったのならよかったよ。", "zh": "哈哈，是吗。\n哪怕能传达给你一点点，就太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1090_047sub", "source_sha256": "cff1a4868f4ca5e1906299cf17fef5faa69f130af37b947286427fb78a98800f", "ja": "あ……ねえ、{$P$}。\nオレのソロ曲って、もう決まってるの？", "zh": "啊……对了，{$P$}。\n我的独唱曲，已经定下来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1091_p", "source_sha256": "debc7954358b8f43eee2553d434a851271befd78c9524aeec7909b0969385200", "ja": "ああ、その事なんだけど……\n昴には新曲を歌ってもらおうかと思ってるんだ。", "zh": "啊，说到这件事……  \n我在想，要不要让昴唱一首新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1092_047sub", "source_sha256": "a7a84e85bf5f22552e3a83cf71ebbd515e7a01dd81593ae82b69487864e346e4", "ja": "ええ、新曲！？\nそ、そんなのあったっけ？", "zh": "诶，新歌！？\n有、有这种歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1093_p", "source_sha256": "897b0db9a7f6bcc555a3f3d2aa315e2096c826a229db0feb59e888587aeac15c", "ja": "ちょうど準備していたところだったんだ。初披露が\n『ブレイク！』なら、これ以上ない話題になるはずだ。", "zh": "我正好准备来着。如果新歌能在《Break!》上首次公开，肯定会成为无可比拟的话题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1094_047sub", "source_sha256": "05f620e6b55b4b6788ee395e62bd500ce0f375f514d5c35e73d90a15c6eb0b39", "ja": "うん……わかった。オレ、本番でもその曲を\n歌えるように、オーディションがんばるよ！", "zh": "嗯……我知道了。为了在正式演出时也能\n唱那首歌，试镜我会全力以赴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1095_p", "source_sha256": "4dddbf82deb0990875c4c0d8d844822b513e6095f4bae9432695f12473377beb", "ja": "期待してるぞ。\n宿題のほうも、そのうち答えを聞かせてくれ。", "zh": "我很期待哦。\n作业那边也要记得找时间告诉我答案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1096_047sub", "source_sha256": "64216ec9d659e446e993ec5303cb260a7ba405fcf584cf92df5f309eab92fced", "ja": "あっ！　そうだった……\nいや、忘れてないって！　そっちもがんばる！", "zh": "啊！对了……  \n不是，我没忘！那边我也会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1097_null", "source_sha256": "a89d7d4876e79ceff8377e82917647cf2f4baac4d6025a2e03db31bbafca6f16", "ja": "そして、合同レッスン最終日……", "zh": "然后，是联合练习的最后一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1098_033sih", "source_sha256": "68277f2a9dd0e052a87ff9694781adaeb29b8359dee346934328346b91b1a994", "ja": "オーディション、いよいよですね。\n喉を温めておかないと……ふぅ。", "zh": "试镜终于要开始了。\n不先把嗓子热开可不行……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1099_047sub", "source_sha256": "d98e2d7efbef151a56bb1a0b07af377d7c247567ffaf0bbe2ea014d767f0c18b", "ja": "ああ。ここまで来たら、あとは思いっきりやるだけだ。\n難しいこと考えてもしょうがないからな。", "zh": "啊。都走到这一步了，接下来只要尽情发挥就行。\n再去想那些复杂的事也没用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1100_050jul", "source_sha256": "225e3bd35a925e104a5a5e71290ef7da0a8444c186b4c8e70c1b7f8356353849", "ja": "いいね、覚悟が決まってるじゃないか。\nちょっと前までとは大違いだ。", "zh": "不错嘛，已经下定决心了。\n和不久前相比，真是判若两人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1101_047sub", "source_sha256": "3e500a2d92be174c8556524483e7ae88dc851812b3f40a223e83919081f5b582", "ja": "ふふん。\nオレは『昴』だってわかったからな。", "zh": "哼哼。\n因为我已经明白，我就是“昴”了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1102_031tom", "source_sha256": "a0b2a1148239b60ded649de0f0122c26f7d96a7ce1d0ddb61e4aeb5e67d0effc", "ja": "昴ちゃん、何か自信を持てるようなことが\nあったんですね～。うふふ。", "zh": "昴小朋友，是发生了什么让你变得这么自信呢～。呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1103_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3fb5f8cb803a4ffb3d9231781a811ca3e0ea002237c360322c373305c2bbc9a2", "ja": "わたしは、昴くんが自信ないほうが不思議だった\nけどな～？　昴くんて、カッコよくてカワイイのに。", "zh": "我倒是一直觉得昂没有自信才比较奇怪呢～？毕竟昂明明又帅气又可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1104_050jul", "source_sha256": "147d4fd9aef9e154587cee37aad32e7a70851e9098d2afac9275b9d2803d9501", "ja": "まあ、こっちとしてはあのままでいてくれたほうが、\n競争相手が減ってありがたかったけどな。ははっ！", "zh": "不过对我来说，要是你一直那样的话，\n倒是少了个竞争对手，我反而省心了。哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1105_047sub", "source_sha256": "70be714e285f37b1d698c82e9f7eb18580e7570bc16f378f2828fff960831099", "ja": "なにー！？　言っとくけど、オレは\nジュリアにだって負けるつもりないからな！", "zh": "什么——！？先说好，我可没打算输给茱莉亚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1106_050jul", "source_sha256": "ffef319bf8cbc0d8c90e1d1c287ead9253641bde13b5ff5f636409ee906632e3", "ja": "お、言ったな？\nその勝負、受けて立ってやるよ！", "zh": "哦，说出口了啊？\n这场较量，我奉陪到底！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1107_031tom", "source_sha256": "2c66a63a0f4416052bb6b211ce59f5190c30f2c2d4d7cfe6c00a2ceed141abf2", "ja": "私ももちろん、手加減はしませんよ～。", "zh": "我当然也不会手下留情哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1108_033sih", "source_sha256": "36019a067f203d76ab355abedbd74dbd8ca62779e7e194b7b245f4cee603673a", "ja": "望むところです。", "zh": "正合我意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1109_016tsu", "source_sha256": "58bcac349dcddc6810b33461124ea08d9643f77083b776e5e29ba52774e4a0e5", "ja": "ねえ、そろそろ始まるみたいだよ！\nわたし達も行こっか。", "zh": "喂，好像差不多要开始了！\n我们也走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1110_047sub", "source_sha256": "d1cbb834aab1cadce2443763d037e1c63f87162631cd6365b207e7cd3e36fcf1", "ja": "あっ……みんな、ちょっと待って！", "zh": "啊……大家，等一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1111_p", "source_sha256": "b32678cc2a1df6433715b01fafd4ff60f7ed5aacf9861c1cc48c98c70c850783", "ja": "どうした、昴。\n忘れ物か？", "zh": "怎么了，昴。\n忘东西了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1112_047sub", "source_sha256": "3515d1367304710ff32f92cf65ded0cae98cbb2a160b1b7fb0cbb8bfdf2b84ea", "ja": "いや、そうじゃなくて……。\nあのさ、円陣組まない？", "zh": "不是，不是那个……\n那个，大家要不要一起围成圆阵打个气？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1113_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ad7f093e5c60708adfa7338b0842da753555bd2e6289e008303362b41246cd91", "ja": "円陣？\nでもわたし達、ライバル同士だよ？", "zh": "围成一圈？\n可是我们是竞争对手吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1114_047sub", "source_sha256": "581cc5d649acb71586a84d8c7d4e13d894a5e61a1c83c0f38f45d7046c07d4e8", "ja": "ライバルだけど、同じ事務所の仲間だろ。\nやっといたほうが気合い入るし。だから……。", "zh": "虽然是对手，但也是同一家事务所的伙伴吧。\n还是先做一下比较能鼓起干劲。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1115_031tom", "source_sha256": "bdf94ed28d03775b3428597f14e494fa52bccf6a75634ba214d11bce756cba81", "ja": "そうですね、やりましょう～。\n声出しにもなりますし～。", "zh": "是啊，那就做吧～  \n也能顺便开开嗓～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1116_050jul", "source_sha256": "51411950ec6c9fa68533d4abae6ee3943e590eb3e117f485e26b51f916afbe41", "ja": "オーケー。\nそれじゃあ、音頭は任せたぜ、昴。", "zh": "好。\n那就交给你来领头了，昴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1117_047sub", "source_sha256": "5ad79374b7252b54b0d88a9daa59e8a6f44ad491f99cdf93a11460fe803d4517", "ja": "お、オレ！？　自分から振っといてあれだけど、\nこういうの、なんて言えばいいんだ……？", "zh": "诶、我！？　虽然是我自己提起的，但这种时候该说什么好呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1118_p", "source_sha256": "4bcbf27c8a8ba6dde1151da074fc0eec599a27cb557a97c82bfb80818aa2beea", "ja": "昴の気持ちを、素直に言えばいいんだよ。", "zh": "直接说出昴的心里话就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1119_033sih", "source_sha256": "17f1513070bca5c04a58a3bfb96ce168b899cddf627b7e60352b9adfddc8fef5", "ja": "そうですね。\n「お前ら全員、倒してやるぜ」とか。", "zh": "就是嘛。\n比如“我要把你们所有人都打倒”之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
