{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_133_1121_047sub", "source_sha256": "23076f9effac94655a38714e0402f488c4885d942aab764bb3d18b03264c0150", "ja": "正直、誰が勝つかわからないけど。\nだから……。", "zh": "说实话，还真不知道谁会赢。\n所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
